---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy" description="Privacy policy for fairy-pitta.net.">
  <header class="page-head">
    <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-path rise" style="--i:0"><a href="/">fairy-pitta</a>/privacy</p>
    <h1 class="page-title rise" style="--i:1">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="lead rise" style="--i:2">What this site collects, and what it does with it.</p>
    <dl class="label-list rise" style="--i:3">
      <div><dt>Last updated</dt><dd><time datetime="2026-09-30">2026-09-30</time></dd></div>
    </dl>
  </header>
  <article class="prose">
    <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>
      This website may collect basic analytics information to understand how visitors interact with the site.
      We do not collect personal information unless you voluntarily provide it through contact forms.
    </p>

    <h2>How We Use Information</h2>
    <p>
      Any information collected is used solely to improve the website experience and respond to inquiries.
      We do not sell, trade, or share your information with third parties.
    </p>

    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <p>
      This website may use cookies to enhance user experience and for basic analytics.
      You can disable cookies in your browser settings if you prefer.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      If you have any questions about this privacy policy, please contact us through the contact form on this website.
    </p>
  </article>
</Layout>
